droom 4: 26.6 of 100 m\u00b2, 1 of 5 nodes.","Living next door could join, but it's with H1: that zoning has the same hub count and less cable.","Stands in Bedroom 4, at least 0.5 m from walls: of 3362 allowed spots in its zone, this one gives the shortest ring. The most open spot, which a simple method would pick, adds 0.5 m.","Visits H4 \u2192 N4 Bedroom 4 \u2192 H4 (with this few nodes there is only one ring).","Ring: 0.4 m of cable, 2 bends, 0 crossings, 0.2 m overlapping itself."]},"hub_count":{"H":4,"by_area":2,"by_nodes":2,"alone":[]},"lower_bound":{"J":35.88,"gap_pct":18.4,"complete":true}}}